From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ohnoitsaninja <ohnoitsaninja@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 17 May 2026 17:41:48 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Add experimental BF16 CUDA VAE op support

Extends CUDA BF16 coverage for the VAE compact-activation path, including scale/add/unary/pad/groupnorm/nearest-upscale and BF16 graph I/O through implicit-GEMM conv. Keeps conv internal math on the existing f16/f32 path and leaves production behavior gated by the parent stable-diffusion.cpp VAE flags.

